{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026n9eVZxnMKb1794525258.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國富商馬斯克旗下的SpaceX，計劃在美國兩個超級運算園區投資共740億美元，折合約5,801億港元。</p><p></p><p>SpaceX發表聲明，預計在公司總部星際基地市Starbase投資超過240億美元，並在亞利桑那州園區投資約500億美元。但亞利桑那園區投資計劃仍需獲得當地政府批准。</p><p></p><p>公司表示，在得州星際基地市的投資，已創造超過3,000個建築工作崗位，預計聘請500人運作人工智能數據中心。而在亞利桑那州的投資計劃，預計能創造約5,500個建築工作崗位，以及1,000個永久職位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.272806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:22.712386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:40.920428+00:00","content_hash":"4c8c4d878a8cab93160806549e8e0e93fa38bacd0372363e755b18a208c50526","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.272806+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}